  "title": "RTX invests $100 million to accelerate radar testing and interceptor production in Rhode Island",
  "summary": "Project to bring 150 high-tech jobs to the state PORTSMOUTH, R.I., June 8, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Raytheon, an RTX (NYSE: RTX) business,is investing $100 million to expand its Portsmouth, R.I., facility. The expansion will accelerate Lower Tier Air and Missile Defense Sensor (LTAMDS) testing by increasing capacity and boost Patriot® GEM-T subcomponent production to meet growing global demand.",
